📖 Surah Hud, Ayah 50 

-> Arabic Text

وَإِلَىٰ عَادٍ أَخَاهُمْ هُودًا ۗ قَالَ يَا قَوْمِ اعْبُدُوا اللَّهَ مَا لَكُم مِّنْ إِلَـٰهٍ غَيْرُهُ ۖ إِنْ أَنتُمْ إِلَّا مُفْتَرُونَ

🔑 Roman Transliteration

Wa ilaa ‘Aadin akhaahum Hoodan, qaala yaa qawmi’ budul laaha maa lakum min ilaahin ghairuh; in antum illaa muftaroon.

🌍 Translation (Roman Urdu)

“(Aur) Aad ki qaum ki taraf unke bhai Hood ko (bheja). Unhone kaha: ‘Aey meri qaum! Allah ki ibadat karo, tumhara uske siwa koi ma’bood nahi. Tum sirf jhoot ghad karte ho.’”

💡 Tafseer / Simple Explanation

Allah ne Qaume ‘Aad ki taraf Hazrat Hood (عليه السلام) ko bheja.
Unka pegham ek hi tha: sirf Allah ki ibadat karo, uske siwa koi ilaah nahi.
Agar tum auron ko ma’bood mante ho, to yeh sirf ek jhooti baat (iftira) hai.

👉 Is ayat mein hidayat yeh hai ke shirk sabse bada jhoot hai. Haqeeqat sirf Allah ki ibadat hai.

_______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

👉"Mushrikeen"

"Mushrikeen" (مشرکین) ka matlab hai wo log jo shirk karte hain — yani Allah Ta’ala ke saath kisi ko ya kisi cheez ko uski zaat, sifat, ibadat, ya hukumat mein shareek thahrate hain.

📖 Quran mein:

Allah Ta’ala ne shirk ko sabse bara gunaah bataya:

إِنَّ اللَّهَ لَا يَغْفِرُ أَنْ يُشْرَكَ بِهِ
“Beshak Allah shirk ko kabhi maaf nahi karta (agar insaan tawbah kiye baghair mar gaya), aur iske siwa jise chahe maaf kar deta hai.”
(Surah An-Nisa 4:48)

🔹 Mushrikeen ke Aamaal:

Allah ke ilawa buton, devi-devtaon, piro-faqiron, ya qubro se madad mangna.
Allah ke siwa kisi aur ke liye sajda, dua, ya qurbani karna.
Kehna ke Allah ke sath koi “beta/beti” ya sharik hai (jaise Quraysh aur Yahood/Nasara ka aqeeda tha).

🔹 Quraysh Mushrikeen:

Makkah ke log jinhein “Mushrikeen-e-Makkah” kaha jata hai.
Wo log Kaaba ko Allah ka ghar maante the, lekin uske aas paas 360 but rakh kar unki ibadat karte the.
Kehte the: “Hum buton ki ibadat is liye karte hain taake wo hume Allah ke qareeb kar dein.” (Surah Az-Zumar 39:3)

🔹 Islam ka hukm:

Mushrik hona insaan ko Islam se bahar kar deta hai.
Agar koi shakhs shirk se bach kar sirf Allah ki ibadat kare to wahi Islam hai.
Kya aap chahte ho main aapko shirk ke mukhtalif qisam (hidden shirk, open shirk, aqeedi shirk, amali shirk) bhi detail mein samjhaun?





